Package: clipplotr
Title: Comparative Visualisation of CLIP Data
Version: 1.9.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Anob M.", "Chakrabarti", email = "a.chakrabarti@ucl.ac.uk", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph")),
    person("Charlotte", "Capitanchik", role = c("aut", "cph")),
    person("Jernej", "Ule", role = "cph"),
    person("Nicholas", "Luscombe", role = "cph"))
Description: Plots multiple CLIP crosslink tracks across a gene or region of
    interest with a range of normalisation and smoothing options, together
    with optional peak (auxiliary), coverage and gene annotation tracks.
    Usable from R or from the command line.
